# Base URL of the SecureTrap API that this dashboard talks to.
#
#   * An absolute URL such as http://localhost:8000 sends requests across
#     origins. The API must then allow this dashboard's origin through its
#     SECURETRAP_CORS_ORIGINS setting (the API's default allowed origin is
#     http://localhost:3000, which is the port this project's dev server uses).
#   * Leave it empty (or unset) to call the API on the same origin as the
#     dashboard, for example when a reverse proxy serves both.
#   * A path such as /securetrap-api is also accepted (same origin, prefixed).
#
# Copy this file to .env.local to override the development default in
# .env.development, or set the variable in the environment of a production
# build. Values are baked into the build at build time.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
